1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,639
This essay has been on your list for a week.

2
00:00:02,669 --> 00:00:04,590
And you still haven't started.

3
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:06,525
The problem isn't you.

4
00:00:06,555 --> 00:00:08,476
The task is just too big.

5
00:00:09,076 --> 00:00:11,637
So smash it into three smaller steps.

6
00:00:11,937 --> 00:00:13,124
Step one.

7
00:00:13,154 --> 00:00:14,555
Choose a topic.

8
00:00:14,585 --> 00:00:16,208
About twenty minutes.

9
00:00:16,508 --> 00:00:17,717
Step two.

10
00:00:17,747 --> 00:00:19,169
Write an outline.

11
00:00:19,199 --> 00:00:20,843
About thirty minutes.

12
00:00:21,143 --> 00:00:22,373
Step three.

13
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:23,953
Draft one section.

14
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:25,179
That's it.

15
00:00:25,479 --> 00:00:28,894
Each step starts with a verb, and fits in one sitting.

16
00:00:29,494 --> 00:00:32,098
Now you don't have to write an essay tonight.

17
00:00:32,398 --> 00:00:34,554
You just have to choose a topic.

18
00:00:35,154 --> 00:00:36,427
One task.

19
00:00:36,457 --> 00:00:38,144
Three smaller steps.

20
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:40,764
Try it on your next big task.
